":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bv5TPT00UnZCy9lfXGPo9VGuviH.jpg"},{"name":"Borat: VHS Cassette of Material Deemed \"Sub-Acceptable\" by Kazakhstan Ministry of Censorship and Circumcision","year":2021,"character":"Tutar Sagdiyev","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/VjewbEjJu0RZ2ENIwxeGKMHhZJ.jpg"},{"name":"Last Call","year":2020,"character":"Alexandra","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/et9WbhiXBeBLLsbrkvR0iXMLJKq.jpg"},{"name":"Borat Subsequent Moviefilm: Delivery of Prodigious Bribe to American Regime for Make Benefit Once Glorious Nation of Kazakhstan","year":2020,"character":"Tutar Sagdiyev","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/3L1Ml5RWjFVfVq3rQENvgFymT0U.jpg"},{"name":"The Father","year":2019,"character":"Valentina","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vOPfERSnQ0vDVIGw6L7PUOTxqlB.jpg"},{"name":"The Kelly Clarkson Show","year":2019,"character":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sBix25bie9UQFzbarN51DpFO5ky.jpg"},{"name":"Transgression","year":2018,"character":"Yana","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hhkiqOBuSmg7g6hDEvsGhwSzHa3.jpg"},{"name":"Angels","year":2018,"character":"Angela","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iRysOnBlNah7BtKgn49RXFE5GU9.jpg"},{"name":"XIIa","year":2017,"character":"Milena","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nAHo8cbuC7ls4XaYcGqQP1JyWLn.jpg"},{"name":"Showdown in Manila","year":2016,"character":"Exchange Student","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pQGE2nZ6OQKSDWekXyfiBYWFMxA.jpg"},{"name":"Tipichno","year":2013,"character":"Maria","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ntUyFtfRR42Qqy0u1XQ5ppbZ0bG.jpg"},{"name":"Jimmy Kimmel Live!","year":2003,"character":"Tatar Sagdiyev","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bGB6bEbG4qL22C1SFupkdAxYC9i.jpg"},{"name":"The View","year":1997,"character":"Self - Guest","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pEUNIxCMh2jFjUj7u09f4O5CcR4.jpg"},{"name":"MTV Movie & TV Awards","year":1992,"character":"Self - Presenter","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lPsSVqXFott193XjMpBS2qNsdWw.jpg"},{"name":"LIVE with Kelly and Mark","year":1988,"character":"Self - Guest","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8eXDNLIhOGSoKCaIw9JJFNbnZ5x.jpg"},{"name":"The Oscars","year":1953,"character":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wyMHJMQp8WpmBg9CxefvbQnFhrm.jpg"},{"name":"Floodplain","year":0,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"Untitled Spy Comedy","year":0,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"Birds of Prey","year":0,"character":"Nina","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"The Brand","year":0,"character":"Lilly","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/q2LDXTnT4n2xSAmSqV5dfxrCgb9.jpg"},{"name":"My Masterpiece","year":0,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"God's Country","year":0,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nOLKFnSmZXzs24N4St21Ag7r1qm.jpg"},{"name":"Double Blind","year":0,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"Override","year":0,"character":"Rush","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"No Way Off","year":0,"character":"Laura","mediaType":"movie","poster":"","characterFa":"لورا"},{"name":"Snake Island","year":0,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":""},{"name":"Get Off Your Phone","year":0,"character":"Rada","mediaType":"movie","poster":""}],"nameFa":"ماریا باکالووا","bioFa":"ماریا والچوا باکالووا (/bəˈkɑːləvə/ bə-KAH-lə-və؛ متولد ۴ ژوئن ۱۹۹۶) یک بازیگر بلغاری است. او جوایز مختلفی را دریافت کرده است، از جمله جایزه فیلم منتخب منتقدان و نامزدی جایزه آکادمی، جایزه بفتا، جایزه انجمن بازیگران نمایشگر و جایزه گلدن گلوب. \n\nباکالووا که در بورگاس به دنیا آمد و بزرگ شد، کار خود را در سینمای بلغارستان و همزمان با حضور در آکادمی ملی هنرهای تئاتر و فیلم آغاز کرد. او بیشتر نقش‌های دراماتیک را در فیلم‌هایی مانند «تجاوز» (2017)، «پدر» (2019)، «آخرین تماس» (2020) و «زن‌ها گریه می‌کنند» (2021) به تصویر کشید. او پس از بازی در فیلم مستند Borat Subsequent Moviefilm ۲۰۲۰ که نامزدی جایزه اسکار بهترین بازیگر نقش مکمل زن را به همراه داشت، به شهرت رسید. \n\nباکالووا از آن زمان در فیلم‌هایی با ژانرهای مختلف بازی کرده است، از جمله Bodies Bodies Bodies (2022) و The Apprentice  (2024). او همچنین نقش‌های صداپیشگی داشته است، از جمله در فیلم دنیای سینمایی مارول، جلد Guardians of the Galaxy. 3 (2023) به عنوان Cosmo the Spacedog و در سری DC Universe Creature Commandos (2024).\n\nشرح بالا از مقاله ویکی‌پدیا ماریا باکالووا، با مجوز CC-BY-SA، فهرست کامل مشارکت‌کنندگان در ویکی‌پدیا.","birthPlaceFa":"بورگاس، بلغارستان","bioFaAttribution":"Description above from the Wikipedia article Maria Bakalova, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","bioFaLicense":"CC-BY-SA"}}
